築宮室，多其美女玩好，以娛其耳目，分此二人，各置一方，使如瑜者得挾與攻戰，大事可定也。今猥割土地以資業之，聚此三人，俱在疆場，恐蛟龍得雲雨，終非池中物也。」權以曹公在北方，當廣攬英雄，又恐備難卒制，故不納。是時劉璋為益州牧。外有張魯寇侵，瑜乃詣京見權曰：「今曹操新折衄，方憂在腹心，未能與將軍連兵相事也。乞與奮威俱進取蜀，得蜀而並張魯，因留奮威固守其地，好與馬超結援。瑜還與將軍據襄陽以蹙操，北方可圖也。」權許之。瑜還江陵為行裝，而道於巴丘病卒，時年三十六。權素服舉哀。感動左右。喪當還吳，又迎之蕪湖，眾事費度，一為供給。後著令曰：「故將軍周瑜、程普，其有人客，皆不得問。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"瑜","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"劉備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"瑜","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"劉備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"關羽","kind":"person","person_id":"1c2_03c_9ea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-zhouyu:line027:m0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"張飛","kind":"person","person_id":"qtm_fq1_1ca","s